#~ "<p>These are all the text jobs.  The <b>State</b> column may be:\n"
#~ "        <ul>\n"
#~ "        <li><b>Queued</b> - the job is waiting and will not be spoken "
#~ "until its state is changed to <b>Waiting</b> by clicking the <b>Resume</"
